      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَجِيزٌ</span></b>  One <i>who does not come to women</i> [<i>by
reason of impotence</i>]: (S, K:) and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَجِيرٌ</span>, (S,
TA,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَجِيسٌ</span>. (TA.) And A stallion <i>impotent to cover:</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَجِيسٌ</span>. (IDrd, O, TA.)

